---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";

const lastUpdated = "April 26, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Reviu, the desktop Git client."
  pathname="/privacy/"
  robots="noindex,follow"
>
  <main class="py-20 sm:py-24">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 lg:px-8">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50"
      >
        ← Back
      </a>
      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        1. Data Controller
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Controller:</span>
          <code>Joris Gallot</code>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Privacy contact:</span>
          <code>contact@reviu.dev</code>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        2. Data We Process
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Depending on your use of Reviu, we may process:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        <li>
          Contact details you provide (for example, support email messages).
        </li>
        <li>
          Account and subscription metadata related to billing and plan status.
        </li>
        <li>
          Technical usage metrics and sampled website session replay data for
          product improvement and reliability.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        3. Purposes and Legal Bases (EEA/UK)
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        <li>Provide and operate the service (performance of a contract).</li>
        <li>
          Handle support and service communications (legitimate interests and/or
          contract).
        </li>
        <li>
          Maintain security, abuse prevention, reliability, and website usability
          (legitimate interests).
        </li>
        <li>
          Comply with accounting, tax, and legal obligations (legal obligation).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        4. Analytics and Session Replay (Umami, Cookieless)
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        We use Umami in cookieless mode for aggregate traffic insights and
        sampled session replay on the website. Session replay helps us understand
        navigation, scrolling, and interaction issues on public marketing pages.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Form input values are masked in replay recordings, but text already
        visible on public pages may appear. We do not use non-essential analytics
        cookies for this setup. If analytics implementation changes in the future
        and non-essential cookies are introduced, this policy and consent
        handling will be updated accordingly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        5. Billing and Payment (Polar)
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        We use Polar as our subscription and billing provider. Payment details
        are processed by Polar and its payment partners according to their
        security and compliance standards.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        6. Hosting and Infrastructure
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Reviu is hosted on infrastructure provided by Hetzner.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        7. Data Sharing
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        We do not sell personal data. We may share data with service providers
        only as needed to provide the service, process subscriptions, secure
        infrastructure, and comply with legal obligations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        8. International Transfers
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        If personal data is transferred outside your jurisdiction, we use
        appropriate safeguards where required by law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">9. Retention</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        We retain personal data only as long as necessary for service delivery,
        legal compliance, dispute resolution, and enforcement of agreements.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        10. Your Rights (EEA/UK)
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        Subject to applicable law, you may request access, rectification,
        deletion, restriction, objection, and portability of your personal data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">
        11. US and California Privacy Notice
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        If US state privacy laws apply to your data, you may have rights to
        know, access, delete, and correct personal information, and to exercise
        non-discrimination rights when using those rights.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">12. Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm/7 text-muted-foreground">
        <code>contact@reviu.dev</code>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
